{"seq":4,"slug":"growth-development","title":"成长与发展","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-development-planning","title":"职业发展规划","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development/career-development-planning","wordCount":1929,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"pip-improvement-plans","title":"绩效改进计划","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development/pip-improvement-plans","wordCount":1863,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"recognition-motivation","title":"认可与激励体系","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development/recognition-motivation","wordCount":2278,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 成长与发展\n\n绩效管理的终极目标不是评分，而是推动人的成长。本章将绩效结果转化为发展行动：职业发展规划帮助表现良好的成员明确下一步方向，绩效改进计划为未达预期者提供结构化的支持路径，认可与激励体系则通过正向强化巩固期望行为。\n\n三篇文档覆盖了绩效结果的全谱系处理——从高绩效者的加速成长、到低绩效者的改进支持、再到日常的认可激励设计。学完本章，你将能够将绩效评估的输出转化为每位团队成员的具体发展行动。\n"}